<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE-KNP BT H1 total net profit 157 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE-KNP BT H1 total net profit 157 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)		 1.16 vs   0.82</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops     137    vs 101</p>
<p>    Total net after extraordinaries  157    vs 101</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		    6.52 vs   6.71</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected paper and office equipment group NV Koninklijke KNP BT to post a 1997 first-half net from ordinary operations of between 105 and 142 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit		     287    vs 247</p>
<p>    Interest charges			86    vs  74</p>
<p>    Tax					 67    vs  51</p>
<p>    Associates' income		    17    vs  13 charge</p>
<p>    Minorities charge		     14    vs   8</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gains		   20    vs nil</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
